Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:10.00,zhu,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}本字幕由豌豆字幕组制作 仅供学习交流 禁止用于商业用途
Comment: 0,0:03:55.01,0:03:55.05,op-jp,,0,0,0,,==========OP==========
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.79,0:04:04.14,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}ねえ その手で壊して 不条理な運命
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.69,0:04:18.56,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}飲み込まれた 怪物の胃袋
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.31,0:04:26.75,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}あれからずっと 絡みつく錆びた鎖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.75,0:04:34.41,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}気づかずにいたなら 闇でも怖くなかった
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.41,0:04:42.68,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}ねえ その手で壊して 不条理な運命
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.03,0:04:57.64,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}切り裂いてその剣で 本当の世界見せて
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.64,0:05:09.41,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}猛毒に溶け出して 私でなくなる前に
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.51,0:05:18.09,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}さぁ その手で壊して 千切れない罪と私を
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.09,0:05:25.18,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}二度ともう戻れない 不条理な目覚めね
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.18,0:05:32.85,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}さぁ その手で壊して 奈落へと連れて行って
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.85,0:05:37.37,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}もう忘れない まだ痛い
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.37,0:05:40.78,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,0)}君のこと ケシたい
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.79,0:04:04.14,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}亲手去打破吧 这不公的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.69,0:04:18.56,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}被怪物吞食 落入胃中
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.31,0:04:26.75,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}自那之后 始终身缠生锈锁链
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.75,0:04:34.41,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}若视而不见 则不畏黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.41,0:04:42.68,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}亲手去打破吧 这不公的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.03,0:04:57.64,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}用那把剑披荆斩棘 让我看到真实的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.64,0:05:09.41,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}在我被剧毒溶解 失去自我之前
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.51,0:05:18.09,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}亲手去打破吧 将我与罪孽分离
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.09,0:05:25.18,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}再也无法回头 这残酷的苏醒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.18,0:05:32.85,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}亲手去打破吧 将我带入地狱深渊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.85,0:05:37.37,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,150)}无法遗忘 痛无止境
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.37,0:05:40.78,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(150,0)}只想将你 一笔抹消
Comment: 0,0:21:36.07,0:21:36.11,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,==========ED==========
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.52,0:21:59.37,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}ワルツを踊る
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.37,0:22:06.05,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}この世界でどうか手を離さずに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.05,0:22:11.36,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}何度となく 行き交うかなしい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.36,0:22:15.03,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}愛しさを躱さずに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.03,0:22:21.05,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}いつしか秘密が普通へと変わり果てても
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.05,0:22:28.04,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}僕らは期待していられるかな ねえ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.04,0:22:32.61,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}強がってなくちゃ崩れきって消える
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.61,0:22:37.79,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}魔法とすら呼べないこの願いを
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.79,0:22:42.21,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}「捨てた方が楽」 多分そうだとして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.21,0:22:46.54,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}それでも絶え間なく螺旋を描く
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.54,0:22:51.85,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}僕らは 恐れを振り解き 幕は開けて来た
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.85,0:22:57.02,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}あの過去はいまと共に在ることを
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:23:01.35,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}「忘れた方が楽」 たとえそうだとして
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.35,0:23:07.68,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}それでも絶え間なく螺旋を描く
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.60,0:23:15.26,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}僕らのワルツ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.26,0:23:21.80,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}僕らのワルツ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.52,0:21:59.37,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}跳起华尔兹
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.37,0:22:06.05,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}在这个世界 请不要松开这双手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.05,0:22:11.36,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}一次又一次 悲伤交汇
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.36,0:22:15.03,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}请不要回避这份爱
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.03,0:22:21.05,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不知不觉中 秘密已化为寻常
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.05,0:22:28.04,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我们是否还能心怀期待呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.04,0:22:32.61,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}若不故作坚强 便会崩塌消失
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.61,0:22:37.79,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}这无法称为魔法的祈愿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.79,0:22:42.21,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}即使将其舍弃才更轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.21,0:22:46.54,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}也依旧无止境地描绘螺旋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.54,0:22:51.85,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我们抛开恐惧 大幕渐起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.85,0:22:57.02,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}那段过去如今也与我们同在
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.02,0:23:01.35,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}即使将其忘却才更轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.35,0:23:07.68,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}也依旧无止境地描绘螺旋
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.60,0:23:15.26,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我们的华尔兹
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.26,0:23:21.80,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我们的华尔兹
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.80,0:00:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,德国…吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.33,0:00:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,对 德国发生了离奇死亡案
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.08,0:00:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,女王命令我去调查
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.82,0:00:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,死者的年龄和性别各异 但有一个共同点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,伐乌鲁夫森林
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.15,0:00:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,伐乌鲁夫…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.51,0:00:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是…狼人森林？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.35,0:00:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.30,0:00:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,传说踏入森林就会被魔女诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.16,0:00:34.99,zhu,,0,0,0,,你们是什么人 怎么进来的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.71,0:00:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这个村子里只有女人？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.01,0:00:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 这是几百年前的装束啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.79,0:00:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫齐格琳德·沙利文
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.76,0:00:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是这座森林的领主
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.85,0:00:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你小子是哪个地盘的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.99,0:00:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那我失陪片刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.74,0:00:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我一个人要怎么应付她啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.95,0:00:51.78,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,870)\3c&H3E3E3E&}喂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.03,0:00:54.41,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,870)\3c&H3E3E3E&}黑发 男人 名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.76,0:00:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.29,0:00:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.32,0:01:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静下来听 还是能听出几个单词嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.96,0:01:02.42,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,870)\3c&H3E3E3E&}你 父母 哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.08,0:01:06.63,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,870)\3c&H3E3E3E&}父母…在…不在了 死了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.46,0:01:09.21,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准圆_GBK\fsp5\fs50\bord3\pos(960,870)\3c&H3E3E3E&}！…这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.56,0:01:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,狼人究竟是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.57,0:01:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你们知道魔女狩猎吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.56,0:01:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,随着时代变迁 魔女逐渐被视为异端
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.00,0:01:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,被人类追杀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.45,0:01:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,当时 一名魔女为了保护同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.39,0:01:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,献祭自己的双腿 和狼人缔结了契约
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.24,0:01:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,所以家族有规定
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.74,0:01:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,要剥夺世代领主的行走能力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.81,0:01:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,狼 狼人出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.98,0:01:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你的护符呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.31,0:01:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,狼人发怒了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.96,0:01:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,要是不想被狼人大卸八块 就赶紧滚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.58,0:01:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,淑女竟在男士的房门外偷听 实在有些不妥吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.98,0:01:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,请问您有何贵干呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.20,0:02:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我说说我所不知道的外面的世界吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.84,0:02:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,受不了 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.66,0:02:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才很抱歉 我们友好相处吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.06,0:02:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 这个给你们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.89,0:02:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这是防狼人袭击的护符 回程时戴上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.86,0:02:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.63,0:02:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,狼 狼人？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.90,0:02:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我去追狼人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.74,0:02:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,请您回房间等待
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.60,0:02:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我居然…在哭？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,恶魔根本没有会导致流泪的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.99,0:02:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你见过被诅咒的人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.85,0:03:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,见过 那叫一个惨不忍睹
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.86,0:03:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,脸肿成两倍大 全身皮肤都溶解了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.29,0:03:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,其中一个当场就死了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,另一个人也受了刺激 精神失常了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.65,0:03:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这…该不会…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.18,0:03:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,看到狼人的人会被诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.74,0:03:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这是真的…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.19,0:03:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.20,0:03:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,塞…巴斯…蒂安…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.50,0:05:59.71,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准雅宋_GBK\blur3\fsp5\fscx95\bord0.5\fs50\b1\3c&H000000&\3a&H6E&\fad(516,522)\pos(1617,892)}那位执事 外借
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.73,0:06:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,身体…要烧起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.07,0:06:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是…诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.26,0:06:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,沙利文小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.98,0:06:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,请救救少爷 沙利文小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.36,0:06:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,沙利文小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.51,0:06:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,请救救少爷 沙利文小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.93,0:06:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,干什么 想上我的床？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.96,0:06:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这副样子是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.83,0:06:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你们进了森林吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.36,0:06:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.42,0:06:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们甘愿受罚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.55,0:06:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但请您先救救少爷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.19,0:06:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,大小姐 出什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你们两个…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.67,0:06:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔夫 要做净化仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.39,0:06:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,去大釜间做准备
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.85,0:07:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 没时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.09,0:07:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,把衣服脱下来扔进灶台里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,快进入大釜里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.05,0:07:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,什么时候进的森林
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.78,0:07:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,大约15分钟前
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.41,0:07:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶 有点悬啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.88,0:07:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,沃尔夫 烧水
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.87,0:07:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,再多拿些净化用的药草
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.82,0:07:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.18,0:07:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,在我咏唱咒语的时候 把头也浸到水里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.86,0:07:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我说可以了之前不要出来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.86,0:07:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.97,0:07:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,三位命运女神啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.07,0:07:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,于此接受乌尔德之泉的恩惠
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.65,0:08:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.46,0:08:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,之后要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,要净化体内
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.94,0:08:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,喂他喝下药水 再吐出来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.32,0:08:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,用这个
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.03,0:08:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.54,0:08:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,少爷 恕我冒犯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.29,0:08:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,快让他吐出来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.68,0:08:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.59,0:08:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你有没有恶心想吐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.04,0:08:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.84,0:08:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,请救救少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.60,0:08:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那就再喂一次药水
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不要…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.56,0:08:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好难受
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.16,0:08:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.81,0:08:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.73,0:08:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.63,0:09:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,小鬼们 吃饭了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.12,0:09:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,别想用盘子那种高级玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.97,0:09:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,快给我把嘴张开
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.91,0:09:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,别洒出来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.00,0:09:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是你们 要是死了就麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.48,0:09:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,多吃点
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.51,0:09:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.71,0:09:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好难受
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.56,0:09:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我好怕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.76,0:09:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,父亲 母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.68,0:09:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,下一个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.19,0:09:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙死了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.10,0:09:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那群贵族真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.14,0:10:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,下手不知轻重
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.22,0:10:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,总有一天 我也会变成那样…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.68,0:10:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 我会保护你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.16,0:10:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 对了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.29,0:10:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我还有你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.60,0:10:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好温暖
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.82,0:10:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 别把他带走
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.79,0:10:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.32,0:10:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 把我担心坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.99,0:10:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.25,0:10:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我都折寿了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.46,0:10:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.23,0:11:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,您感觉怎样啊 夏尔少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.55,0:11:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,夏尔？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.94,0:11:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,少爷 您怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.22,0:11:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.11,0:11:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,夏尔不要再痛了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.75,0:11:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好黑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.03,0:11:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这是哪里 我好怕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.27,0:11:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,您在说什么 这里一点也不黑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.18,0:11:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那边的人是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,什么也看不见
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.60,0:11:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,难道说…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.32,0:11:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,少爷的眼睛应该是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.43,0:11:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有人…把灯点亮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.60,0:12:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,少 少爷的眼睛…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.46,0:12:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.20,0:12:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你要哭多久啊 真不吉利
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.98,0:12:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定能治好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.54,0:12:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.75,0:12:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他那个状态 我们甚至无法照顾他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.01,0:12:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这是基兹说的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.63,0:12:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不只是我们 塞巴斯蒂安都被他拒绝了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.59,0:12:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,少爷到底怎么了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.89,0:12:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,只准菲尼碰他 也很令人费解
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.67,0:12:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,要怎么办 塞巴斯蒂安
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.35,0:12:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,既然少爷命令我不许碰他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.08,0:12:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就不可以碰他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.56,0:12:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,总而言之
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.11,0:12:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,只能先等沙利文小姐起床 和她商量一下了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.72,0:12:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,各位也去休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.29,0:12:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.96,0:12:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我有点事要做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.64,0:13:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那个诡异的瘴气已经消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.03,0:13:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 依然没有生物的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.52,0:13:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我不可能会被魔物的瘴气伤到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.03,0:13:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.70,0:13:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那瘴气和狼人的真面目到底是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.97,0:13:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,总之
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.74,0:13:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,最好是暂住在狼谷 等少爷康复
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.00,0:13:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,唉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.51,0:13:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这次的对手很克制我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.03,0:14:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,昨晚给您添麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.69,0:14:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我给您准备了上午茶 聊表歉意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.66,0:14:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,请用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.93,0:14:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这可真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.36,0:14:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,沙利文小姐 也请尝尝这个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.31,0:14:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么 真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.79,0:14:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这是最高级的…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.25,0:14:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.86,0:14:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他的眼睛被瘴气伤到了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.74,0:14:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,少爷的眼睛还能恢复吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.47,0:14:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,只有去看看才知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.45,0:14:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但他不让任何人接近他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.68,0:14:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.76,0:14:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不知为何 他只允许家中的园丁触碰他
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.93,0:14:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,原来他喜欢肌肉型和肥胖型的折中啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.78,0:14:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他的喜好果然挺偏激
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.14,0:14:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,沙利文小姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.08,0:14:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.39,0:15:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,狼人森林的瘴气
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.29,0:15:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,会让人的内心虚弱 让恐惧增长
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.19,0:15:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,只允许园丁触碰 或许有什么理由
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.39,0:15:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.09,0:15:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那少爷或许是在拒绝成年人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.92,0:15:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.95,0:15:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,少爷也有自己的隐情
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.55,0:15:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.73,0:15:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,比起这个 森林的瘴气究竟是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.27,0:15:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,瘴气是狼人释放出的邪恶魔力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.51,0:15:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,被瘴气侵蚀的人会遭到诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.04,0:15:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,变成像魔物一样的怪异外形
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.66,0:15:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,能净化诅咒的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.68,0:15:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我这个绿之魔女制作的秘药
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.22,0:15:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.93,0:15:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,都说了不要进入森林
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.01,0:15:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,都那样千叮万嘱了 为什么要去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.41,0:15:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,狼人也并不想无故伤人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.41,0:16:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.05,0:16:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,住手 沃尔夫拉姆
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.39,0:16:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你问为什么要去森林？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.55,0:16:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经看腻了恶魔和死神
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.55,0:16:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但从未见过狼人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.49,0:16:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,所以很好奇 狼人究竟是什么样的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.57,0:16:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,总而言之
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.21,0:16:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,能解除少爷的诅咒的 只有您一人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.17,0:16:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,正是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.85,0:16:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,沙利文小姐 请您救救少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.92,0:16:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,为此 我愿意听从您的任何命令
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.85,0:16:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.41,0:16:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那么塞巴斯蒂安
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.39,0:16:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,在我给夏尔治疗期间
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.00,0:17:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你要当我的执事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.27,0:17:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰我 不许碰我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.93,0:17:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,少爷 这样乱动会伤到身体的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.22,0:17:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,烦死了 快滚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.17,0:17:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.08,0:17:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,今天也失败了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.94,0:17:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然不清楚人类的恢复速度
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.86,0:17:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多可以痊愈了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.44,0:17:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,要是容貌不堪入目
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.32,0:17:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,去服侍女士就不太合适了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.34,0:17:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.83,0:17:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.66,0:18:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,在我给夏尔治疗期间
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.83,0:18:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你要当我的执事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.59,0:18:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以啊 大小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.47,0:18:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这男人都不知道什么来历
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.17,0:18:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,难得有来自外界的人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.24,0:18:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我有很多事想问他
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.76,0:18:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我决定了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.81,0:18:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1600,1060)}大小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.97,0:18:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(785.6,1060)}我要让他手把手地 教我各种知识
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.69,0:18:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,手把手…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.81,0:18:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,而且沃尔夫
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.41,0:18:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,塞巴斯蒂安比你能干多了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.33,0:18:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你也要一起学习
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.92,0:18:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.81,0:18:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.41,0:18:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我得去准备晨起红茶了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.42,0:18:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,大家早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.06,0:18:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.87,0:18:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.11,0:18:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,村里的女人会帮忙准备食材
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.19,0:19:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,还有帮大小姐梳妆打扮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.90,0:19:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.83,0:19:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉还没自我介绍
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.71,0:19:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫塞巴斯蒂安 暂时担任沙利文小姐的执事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.01,0:19:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫希尔黛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.48,0:19:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,格蕾特
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.92,0:19:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫安妮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.59,0:19:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会在这里叨扰一阵子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.69,0:19:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,如果需要男性帮忙 还请尽管吩咐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.33,0:19:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.51,0:19:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的工作安排如下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.35,0:19:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,巴鲁托去把早餐的食材处理好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.86,0:19:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.35,0:19:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,SNAKE负责擦拭银器
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.26,0:19:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.92,0:19:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这是艾米丽说的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.89,0:19:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,梅琳负责更换床单被套
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.25,0:19:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.88,0:19:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,菲尼 你负责照顾少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.16,0:19:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.79,0:20:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我照顾少爷吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.10,0:20:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,现在能照顾少爷的 也只有你了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.48,0:20:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他吃得下的话 就给他吃点早餐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.43,0:20:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.78,0:20:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他不愿意吃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.66,0:20:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就给他喝加了蜂蜜的热牛奶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.01,0:20:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,牛奶？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.20,0:20:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,以前…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.78,0:20:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,用那个最能哄少爷开心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.23,0:20:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我就去服侍沙利文小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.32,0:20:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,田中先生保持老样子就行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.43,0:20:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 请开始工作吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.07,0:21:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,唉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.97,0:21:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉他随时可能咬我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.41,0:21:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,大小姐 该起床了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.06,0:23:41.07,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正准雅宋_GBK\fscx95\fsp5\blur3\bord0.5\fs70\b1\3c&H000000&\3a&H6E&\pos(960,754.67)}那位执事 服侍
